From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:28:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] llama: space prompt marks by the cost of one recurrent cell

A mark is copied every 256 tokens, or further apart up to 8192, when that cell costs more than the attention cache between marks. An explicit grid is left as it was.
